  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/967745/description_c0fb0a97-6fae-4153-9a6e-65a4d7d72ea4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"200\"></p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/allthemods\" rel=\"nofollow\"><br><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/967745/description_3f558ee0-1f0a-4a42-a0e6-25b997872200.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"483\" height=\"116\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">《All the Mods 9: To the Sky》是《All the Mods》天空包三部曲的完結篇。團隊根據前兩作的經驗，打造出我們最棒的空島生存包。本模組包加入了前作沒有的模組，例如<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forcecraft\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forcecraft</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/forgiving-void\" rel=\"nofollow\">Forgiving Void</a>、<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/oreberries-replanted\" rel=\"nofollow\">Oreberries</a>與<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/utilitarian\" rel=\"nofollow\">Utilitarian</a>。我們期望這能成為至今最具開放性的ATM模組包！</span><br><br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\">加上<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ex-machinis-divitiae-deorum\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ex Machinis: Divitiae Deorum</a>模組，這是ATM自家為Ex Deorum打造的自動化擴充，讓你從前期一路輕鬆自動化到終局資源生產。</span></span></span><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><br></span>`</strong></p><hr><h6 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/RhacdOJ3eqM\" width=\"390\" height=\"222\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/v7XcOBi8A5g\" width=\"390\" height=\"222\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><span><span><iframe style=\"width:390px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/xn7os2v3YbA\" width=\"390\" height=\"222\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><span><span><iframe style=\"width:390px;float:right\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/zqwp-5DagSk\" width=\"390\" height=\"222\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br><br>「All the Mods」真的包含</strong><strong>所有</strong><strong>模組嗎？不，當然沒有。</strong></h6>",
